{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["# 05-2. Multi-Head Attention\n","\n","**핵심 질문:** 여러 head를 쓰면 하나의 attention과 무엇이 달라지는가?\n","\n","`[B,T,D] → [B,H,T,D_head]` shape 변환을 직접 확인하고 head별 attention map을 비교합니다."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["import torch\n","import torch.nn as nn\n","\n","B, T, D, H = 2, 4, 16, 4\n","assert D % H == 0\n","x = torch.randn(B, T, D)\n","print('input:', x.shape)\n"]}],"metadata":{"kernelspec":{"display_name":"Python (pytorch-dl-notebook)","language":"python","name":"pytorch-dl-notebook"}},"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":5}